§ cli-backend limitations ← §§ disclosure                               ⟦⟧
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  I> new : --backend=cli ← llama-perplexity.exe subprocess
  I> chunk-level NLL (not per-token) ← llama-perplexity output-type 0
  I> repeat-pad for texts < 128 tokens ← reach 2×ctx threshold
  W! ratio-unbiased ← same pad-strategy CSL + EN
  ◐ absolute-NLL biased DOWN ← chunks 2+ benefit KV-cache
  ⊘ per-token NLL requires llama-cpp-python ← Py3.14 wheels pending

  backend-decision-matrix :
    real : honest per-token NLL , needs llama-cpp-python (Py3.14 blocked)
    cli  : chunk-NLL + repeat-pad-bias , Py3.14-compatible ← PRODUCTION
    mock : deterministic pseudo-NLL , CI smoke-test only

